.TH VIBEOS-CLOCK-ALARMS 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-clock-alarms \- alarm and timer service of the VibeOS clock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-clock-alarms
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rings alarms and timers and keeps the stopwatch with the clock app closed, and asks vibeos-wakeup to wake the phone for each alarm. It runs as the systemd user service vibeos-clock-alarms.service and owns vibeos.Clock.Alarms on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-clock(1), vibeos-wakeup(8)
